=2 Walkthrough
* Speak to {p:Gumbah} in {z:Bastok Mines} HP #3 (J-7).
** From the {p:Home Point} #3, take the stairs mid-ways on the right, go up then bust a left, cross the bridge on your right and make an immediate right, open the door and {p:Gumbah} will be in the back room. This NPC is NOT sitting next to the Home Point, instead they're in the back room of a home.
* Speak to {p:Brygid} in {z:Bastok Markets} HP #4 (K-9) twice.
* After agreeing to assist her, Brygid will instruct you to select one of a list of NPCs to cosplay for her fashion show's contest.

=3 NPC Outfits
You are to attempt to dress like your selected NPC exactly, ignoring any weapons and focusing on head/body/hands/legs/feet. The list includes:
* **{p:Azima}**:
** Azima is impossible to copy. Her present-day clothing is completely unobtainable for players.
