** Cosplaying as Azima from the past will win you first prize, netting you an extra 2,000 {p:Gil}.
** A /lockstyle combination of {@i:Coven Hat|16076} {i:Coven Hat|Coven Hat|16076}, {@i:Marduk's Jubbah|14558} {i:Marduk's Jubbah|Marduk's Jubbah|14558}, {@i:Mdk. Dastanas +1|27931} {i:Mdk. Dastanas +1|Mdk. Dastanas +1|27931}, {@i:Mdk. Shalwar +1|28074} {i:Mdk. Shalwar +1|Mdk. Shalwar +1|28074}, and {@i:Arch. Sabots +1|27335} {i:Arch. Sabots +1|Arch. Sabots +1|27335} only earned 20,202 {p:Gil} for first place.

* **{p:Naji}**:
** {@i:Gavial Mail|12565} {i:Gavial Mail|Gavial Mail|12565}, {@i:Breeches|12810} {i:Breeches|Breeches|12810}, and {@i:Battle Boots|12980} {i:Battle Boots|Battle Boots|12980}. No head or hand wear.

* **{n:Black Mud}**:
** {@i:Wool Hat|12474} {i:Wool Hat|Wool Hat|12474}, {@i:Doublet|12592} {i:Doublet|Doublet|12592}, {@i:Slops|12856} {i:Slops|Slops|12856}, and {@i:Ash Clogs|12984} {i:Ash Clogs|Ash Clogs|12984}. No hand wear.
*** This is another easy option. {i:Doublet|Doublet|12592} and {i:Slops|Slops|12856} can be bought from a {p:Sparks} vendor. The {i:Wool Hat|Wool Hat|12474} can be purchased from {n:Chetak} in {z:Lower Jeuno} (H-9).

