* **{n:Nbu Latteh}**:
** {@i:Bronze Harness|12576} {i:Bronze Harness|Bronze Harness|12576}, {@i:Scale Cuisses|12816} {i:Scale Cuisses|Scale Cuisses|12816}, and {@i:Scale Greaves|12944} {i:Scale Greaves|Scale Greaves|12944}. No head or hand coverings.
*** This is the easiest and cheapest outfit to copy. All 3 pieces of this armor are available for ~3,000 from vendors at **Brunhilde Armorer** in {z:Bastok Markets} HP #1 (E-10), or also available from {p:Sparks} for a very low cost.

* Once you have made your selection, head outside **The Steaming Sheep** in {z:Port Bastok} HP #3 (E-7) and speak to {n:Ruenda} while wearing your costume (make sure to either /lockstyle off or create an Equip. Set).
** This is a long cutscene, 5+ minutes with fastCS and Enternity.
* After the cutscene, speak to {p:Brygid} once more to receive your reward.

=2 Notes
* If working multiple accounts simultaneously, any tradeable gear can be passed along to alts:
** Set and enable the lockstyle with the intended gear outside of **The Steaming Sheep** (will not persist through zone), trade the gear to the next character, repeat as needed.

